{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-plugin-pyrun#card-zh","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-plugin-pyrun","commit":"2734263387dbd8d45d42086bf364b8bfe6cf773d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"pyrun 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的 Python 执行工具：它把程序源码经 stdin 交给 Python，并以 UTF-8 收集输出。插件注册 python 工具，支持指定工作目录、运行前保存源码、设置前台超时，并可在 jobs 服务可用时启动后台作业、查看增量输出和停止任务。适合在 DSH 会话中快速运行单段或多行 Python。运行需要 PATH 中有 python；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:391-428","src/index.js:471-508"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-plugin-pyrun#card-en","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-plugin-pyrun","commit":"2734263387dbd8d45d42086bf364b8bfe6cf773d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"pyrun adds a Python tool to DSH. It sends code through stdin and captures UTF-8 output. Choose a working directory, save source before running, or set a foreground timeout. With jobs support, run work in the background and collect or stop it. Python must be on PATH; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:391-428","src/index.js:471-508"]}
