{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-plugin-pyrun#feature-1","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-plugin-pyrun","commit":"2734263387dbd8d45d42086bf364b8bfe6cf773d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"pyrun 的功能「直接运行 Python」：将 code 参数原样通过 stdin 交给 Python，以 UTF-8 模式运行并返回 stdout、stderr 和退出状态。无需 shell 引号转义，也不用先创建临时脚本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:35-43","src/index.js:471-478","src/index.js:507-508"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-plugin-pyrun#feature-2","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-plugin-pyrun","commit":"2734263387dbd8d45d42086bf364b8bfe6cf773d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"pyrun 的功能「保存并运行源码」：调用时设置 save_to，可在启动程序前通过会话文件系统写入源码；相对路径按工作目录解析，结果会返回保存路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:177-200","src/index.js:457-470"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-plugin-pyrun#feature-3","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-plugin-pyrun","commit":"2734263387dbd8d45d42086bf364b8bfe6cf773d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"pyrun 的功能「后台 Python 作业」：设置 run_in_background 后立即获得作业编号；作业输出可用 job_output 收集，也可用 job_kill 停止。此能力取决于运行环境提供 jobs 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:481-505"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-plugin-pyrun#feature-4","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-plugin-pyrun","commit":"2734263387dbd8d45d42086bf364b8bfe6cf773d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"pyrun 的功能「工作目录与前台超时」：可指定 workdir 和 timeout_ms；相对工作目录按会话当前目录解析，后台运行不能同时设置前台超时。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:157-162","src/index.js:339-350","src/index.js:457-478"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-plugin-pyrun#caveat-1","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-plugin-pyrun","commit":"2734263387dbd8d45d42086bf364b8bfe6cf773d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"pyrun 使用前须知：运行环境需要在 PATH 中有 python 解释器；插件代码直接调用 python 命令，没有自行探测解释器位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:35-43","README.md:49-50"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-plugin-pyrun#caveat-2","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-plugin-pyrun","commit":"2734263387dbd8d45d42086bf364b8bfe6cf773d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"pyrun 使用前须知：程序无法读取交互式 stdin，因为 stdin 用来传入程序源码；需要交互输入的脚本不适用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:471-478","src/index.js:224-236"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-plugin-pyrun#caveat-3","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-plugin-pyrun","commit":"2734263387dbd8d45d42086bf364b8bfe6cf773d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"pyrun 使用前须知：设置 save_to 会在程序启动前把源码写入会话文件系统；写入被拒时程序不会启动，成功保存的文件会留在指定位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:177-200","src/index.js:457-470"]}
